<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 31-DEC					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 31-DEC					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical cyclone Phil is mainly a risk to shipping as it stays off shore to the north of West Australia during the next 48 hours. Top winds near the center of Phil have dropped to 65 mph. Phil will track west-southwest and weaken this period, becoming less and less of a threat to shipping with time.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS  </p>
